      "created_at": "2022-05-30T12:54:51Z",
      "updated_at": "2022-05-30T12:54:51Z",
      "body": "I don't think it's a good idea to inform users which other users are using a destination address. I would consider that a breach of privacy.\r\n\r\nIt might be okay to tell a user that \"some other user is already using this destination address\", but that should still not prevent a user from doing so.\r\n\r\nAlso, I would consider this a very low priority issue.",
