      "created_at": "2022-05-31T07:40:43Z",
      "updated_at": "2022-05-31T07:40:43Z",
      "body": "I agree with @lunkwill42. It is sufficient for a user to know whether a destination already exists or not. If they do get spam they can ask an admin to figure out who else uses that destination. IIRC per user, a destination should only exist once anyway but how to tell a user that they've already made that specific destination is out of scope for this issue.",
